flowchart TB
    App[App.OnStartup / ShowLogin] --> Runtime[DatabaseRuntime.InitializeAsync]
    Runtime --> Lease[InstanceLease до миграций]
    Runtime --> EF[AppDbContext / InitialCreate / SeedData]
    App --> Views[AuthWindow / MainWindow / EditorWindow]
    Views --> VM[AuthViewModel / MainViewModel / EditorViewModel]
    VM --> Contracts[Core: IAuthService / IProfileService / ICatalogService / IPantryService / IMenuService]
    Contracts --> Facade[Infrastructure: HomeMenuService]
    Facade --> Session[UserSession / SessionTicket]
    Facade --> Gate[DatabaseRuntime.Gate / Revision]
    Facade --> EF
    EF --> SQLite[(SQLite: локальный файл)]
    Facade --> Pure[Core: NutritionCalculator / RecipeCalculator / MenuGenerator / PantryAllocator / PlanAnalysis]
    VM --> Dialog[IDialogService / DialogService]
    Pure --> Models[Core: модели и DTO]
